reading: shutdown order is app.close() (grace 5 s, then remaining connections destroyed) -> inFlight.settled(3 000 ms) -> db.destroy() -> process.exit(0); backstop 10 s exits 1. Every route registered after registerInFlightTracking (server.ts:232, before helmet/cookie/rate-limit/health/modules/static) is tracked; the failed-mutation audit (denials.ts) and the start-up sweep (evidence/routes.ts onReady) are tracked too. The sweep removes only regular files named <lowercase uuid>.part exactly 3 directories below the root, older than 1 h (mtime), never follows a symbolic link (Dirent.isDirectory()/isFile() are false for links; lstat re-check), logs each removal at info with the root-relative key, size and age. Dynamic confirmation: R13-01..R13-03 in 17-e2e-qa-stack-*.log.
